ara-8530, Barisal.','+88(0) 1701-693432','No data','2022-02-10 19:08:57','2022-05-24 17:16:15'),(14,19,'Naogaon','House no. A-61, Dakkhin Chalk Enayetpur, Masterpara, Naogaon-6500','+88 (0) 1701-693441','No data','2022-02-10 19:09:39','2022-02-10 19:09:39'),(15,8,'Chattogram','Grameen Bank (Hathazari Branch), Chittagong University (Beside Gate no. 01), Madanhat, Hathazari, Chattogram- 43330.','+88(0) 1701-693381','No data','2022-02-10 19:10:14','2022-07-26 21:42:31'),(16,25,'Kushtia','Mansur Ali Bhaban (2nd Floor), Opposite of Police Line, Dadapur Sarak, Kushtia- 7000.','+88(0) 1701-693350','No data','2022-02-10 19:11:05','2022-02-10 19:11:05'),(17,31,'Patuakhali','Hoque Bulu Shamajik Hospital, Shiyali, Kholishakhali, Patuakhali-8600.','+88 (0) 1701-693462','No data','2022-02-10 19:12:24','2022-02-10 19:12:24'),(18,26,'Magura','Police lines, Bashtola, Magura-7600','+88 (0) 1701-693477','https://www.google.com/maps/place/Telecom+Bhaban/@23.8085474,90.3492056,17.08z/data=!4m19!1m13!4m12!1m4!2m2!1d90.3465982!2d23.798594!4e1!1m6!1m2!1s0x3755c146b08de6e5:0xb59dc6c680393035!2sgrameen+telecom+bhaban!2m2!1d90.3502063!2d23.8080653!3m4!1s0x3755c146b08de6e5:0xb59dc6c680393035!8m2!3d23.8080653!4d90.3502063','2022-02-10 19:13:11','2022-07-27 17:30:57');

