9740&quot;:259}\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"OutlineElement Ltr SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow: visible; cursor: text; clear: both; position: relative; direction: ltr; font-family: \'Segoe UI\', \'Segoe UI Web\', Arial, Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 12px;\">\r\n<p class=\"Paragraph SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; overflow-wrap: break-word; white-space: pre-wrap; vertical-align: baseline; font-kerning: none; background-color: transparent; color: windowtext; text-align: left;\"><span class=\"TextRun SCXW143684397 BCX0\" lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; color: windowtext; font-size: 14px; line-height: 17.2667px; font-family: Montserrat, Montserrat_EmbeddedFont, Montserrat_MSFontService, sans-serif;\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\" data-contrast=\"auto\"><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\">In his long career, Mr. Hossain was involved many activities in Grameen Bank as well as for different international organizations/representatives with Professor Muhammad Yunus as coordinator on behalf of Grameen Bank. He was also director of many Grameen </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2 SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-position: left bottom; background-image: var(--urlSpellingErrorV2,); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\">Organisations</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\">. Now he is the Director of Grameen </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2 SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-position: left bottom; background-image: var(--urlSpellingErrorV2,); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\">Motsho</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\"> Pashu </span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SpellingErrorV2 SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; background-repeat: repeat-x; background-position: left bottom; background-image: var(--urlSpellingErrorV2,); border-bottom: 1px solid transparent;\">Shampad</span><span class=\"NormalTextRun SCXW143684397 BCX0\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\"> foundation and a General Member of Grameen Trust.</span></span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>','2022-01-10 20:04:41','2022-02-01 00:50:48',1),(12,'Jannat-E-Quanine','Director','Grameen Kalyan','/uploads/members/profile_photo/1685616781_website_-7.JPG','<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<div class=\"xdj266r x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Mrs. Jannat-E Quanine is the Former General Manager and the Chief of International Program Department of Grameen Bank, Head Office, Dhaka, Bangladesh. Mrs. Jannat had been involved with the Grameen Bank since its inception and has been working with the Nobel Peace Laureate Professor Muhammad Yunus, Founder of Grameen Bank. She has more than 37 years of experience in the field of microcredit and financial inclusion. Her personal code number is 04 out of more than 21,000 employees of Grameen Bank.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">She had been assigned and undertook various crucial significant missions and responsibilities in South &amp; Southeast Asia, Middle East, Europe, Africa, North America, South America, and others. She was the Founder Project Director of Kosovo Grameen Missione Arcobaleno Microcredit Fund (KGMAMF), a Grameen Trust microcredit project in Kosovo.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"x11i5rnm xat24cr x1mh8g0r x1vvkbs xtlvy1s x126k92a\" style=\"margin: 0.5em 0px 0px; white-space-collapse: preserve; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: \'Segoe UI Historic\', \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: #050505;\">\r\n<div dir=\"auto\" style=\"font-family: inherit;\">She also has been serving as the member of Boards in different organizations of Bangladesh and as well as in Kosovo.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>','2023-06-01 15:59:37','2023-06-05 20:37:26',1);

