/td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.07258%; height: 18px;\">8.</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 40.9274%; height: 18px;\">Thermometre</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\">150 Pieces</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\">6,75,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 9.07258%; height: 18px;\">9.</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 40.9274%; height: 18px;\">Leaflet</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\">200,000 Pieces</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\">6,50,000</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</body>\r\n</html>',1,'2022-01-06 23:36:23','2022-02-04 16:52:44'),(2,'Diagnosis is Key',3,'/uploads/story/thumb_image/1643943045_diagnosis_story.jpg','/uploads/story/banner_image1643943045_diagnosis_story.jpg','<!DOCTYPE html>\r\n<html>\r\n<head>\r\n</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Receiving quality health care is everyone&rsquo;s right, and for Grameen Kalyan, it starts with the patient&rsquo;s prompt and accurate diagnosis through our health centers. With 25 types of basic tests available at reasonable costs offered through the 140 health centers across the country, Grameen Kalyan tries to live up to its goal. The health workers take on the initial role and help to narrow down the health complication possibilities and guide the patient to the next step. Grameen Kalyan&rsquo;s experienced Lab Technologists run the necessary diagnostic test to detect the specific health complication. Based on the test results, Grameen Kalyan&rsquo;s health professionals decide the patient&rsquo;s physiological situation and assess the risk factors involved whether a single diagnosis is appropriate, or they should talk to specialists to get advanced treatment.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Anguri Begum, a 63-year-old woman has been a patient of Grameen Kalyan&rsquo;s health center in Tangail for over last six years. She says, &ldquo;I come here because it is close to my home. The health workers, DMF, and the visiting doctors are very cordial. They know me, and they know what I need. After the tests, they provide me with the careful treatment I need or consult with doctors at the capital. If I wanted this in a city for the same tests and care, it would have cost me more, and I would not have known anyone there. I feel at peace here because I know the health worker who stands by me through the whole process and the doctors who handle me delicately, and I trust them for best primary health care.&rdquo;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">In our 25 years of dedicated healthcare experience in rural/semi-urban areas, we understand that communication is vital in diagnosing the patient. Therefore, in the sequence of gathering information, integration, and interpretation, we aim to build trust through communication among health professionals, patients, and patients\' family members. Whether during home calls or the visits at our health center, we always listen carefully to our patients to understand their health conditions. Later through our professional observation, interviews, and discussions, we gather further information on medical history to determine the patient&rsquo;s health problem. Apart from these, Grameen Kalyan regularly arranges Satellite (outdoor) Camps &amp; School camps in the locality and oversees disease &amp; diagnosis-specific health drives where people can get expert opinions, consultation, and other health services affordably.</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 0cm; line-height: normal; vertical-align: baseline; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; color: #000000;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Our Basic Tests:</span><span style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>\r\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 555px;\" border=\"1\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">BASIC DIAGNOSTIC TESTS</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">X-RAYS</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">USG</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 54px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 54px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">CBC (TC,DC,Hb%, ESR)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 54px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Fasting Lipid Profile (full)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 54px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">PNS Om View</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 54px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Pregnancy Profile</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 36px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Urine R/E</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 36px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Total Cholesterol</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 36px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Serum Uric Acid</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 36px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Upper and Lower Abdomen</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 36px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Blood Sugar (Reagent)</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 36px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Triglycerides</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 36px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Chest P/A or A/P View</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 36px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Whole Abdomen&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Blood Grouping</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">LDL</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Cervical Spine B/V</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">VDRL</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">HDL</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">Shoulder Joint B/V</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\">&nbsp;</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 18px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 25%; height: 18px;\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">ASO Titer</span><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></td>\r\n<td style=\"wi